<!--
  繁體中文 (Traditional Chinese, Taiwan).

  ⚠ NOT a character conversion of values-zh-rCN. The vocabulary genuinely differs, and a
  converted file reads as mainland text in traditional characters:
      影片 not 视频 · 預設 not 默认 · 設定 not 设置 · 儲存 not 保存 · 載入 not 加载
      檔案 not 文件 · 偵測 not 检测 · 辨識 not 识别 · 支援 not 支持 · 影格 not 帧
      相簿 not 相册 · 網路 not 网络 · 二進位 not 二进制 · 執行 not 运行
  That is why this is a separate file rather than values-zh plus a converter.

  Left in English, as in values/strings.xml: model and tier names, filenames, and units
  (MB, fps, ms, VTCM, SoC, fp16, GPU, CPU, NPU, Vulkan).

  ⚠ gate_blocked and gate_error MUST stay distinguishable. The first is a refusal; the
  second is a fault in our own code, and wording it like a refusal blames the user for it.
-->
